ABot-Recon on Axera NPU
Copyright 2026 AXERA-TECH

This product is an adaptation of ABot-Recon for Axera NPUs (AXCL cards and
on-chip AX650). It includes code derived from the ABot-Recon project and
redistributes model files converted from the released ABot-Recon weights.

